    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/bba465e4ab4b1eb207e689a7774bf2e6.avif?t=1720806750\" width=640 height=240 /></span><br><br>The demo is now live! Drop by the  and check out our Twitter &gt;;)</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>DEEPMESS is a micro-tactics descent into the mind of god. Guide the Pink Slime Mold from the walls of god's cave, where it feeds on leftover thoughts, to carve a new home directly inside the source\u2014the big one's brain.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/89ba9c99d28adc8f5ada347f3196c9bd.poster.avif?t=1720806750\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/89ba9c99d28adc8f5ada347f3196c9bd.webm?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/89ba9c99d28adc8f5ada347f3196c9bd.mp4?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Armed with hammer and nail, plunge your way down through layers of flesh and bone while fighting off divine enemies. Strategize vertically layer-by-layer as you descend through intense combat and lobotomize god.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><br><strong>Lobotomize god through micro-tactics</strong><br>Share one big hammer amongst your units\u2014attack enemies and strike the Nail to destroy the current floor and fall directly into the next floor of combat!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/f45c445e36204867bead4f95d216c576.poster.avif?t=1720806750\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/f45c445e36204867bead4f95d216c576.webm?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/f45c445e36204867bead4f95d216c576.mp4?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Beef up your arsenal at the Slime Bodega</strong><br>Upgrade your unit\u2019s abilities to influence the vertical strategy. Burst open new God Thoughts that provide passive effects on your run. Build up your squad while traversing through the brain-y biomes of god's head.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/a725777ff1304802575c43200ce12820.poster.avif?t=1720806750\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/a725777ff1304802575c43200ce12820.webm?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/a725777ff1304802575c43200ce12820.mp4?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Survive a drum-and-bass-filled bio-hellscape</strong><br>Deadly enemies and hazards fill squishy environments themed around bone, flesh, and brains. Look before your leap as you crash through layers of combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/ae6b90b82971713dcc059fb061ce35f5.poster.avif?t=1720806750\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/ae6b90b82971713dcc059fb061ce35f5.webm?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/ae6b90b82971713dcc059fb061ce35f5.mp4?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Play the demo now!</strong><br><br>DEEPMESS is ongoing development, and planned updates to the demo are coming! Wishlist and join the DEEPMESS Discord to support development!",
    "about_the_game": "DEEPMESS is a micro-tactics descent into the mind of god. Guide the Pink Slime Mold from the walls of god's cave, where it feeds on leftover thoughts, to carve a new home directly inside the source\u2014the big one's brain.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/89ba9c99d28adc8f5ada347f3196c9bd.poster.avif?t=1720806750\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/89ba9c99d28adc8f5ada347f3196c9bd.webm?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/89ba9c99d28adc8f5ada347f3196c9bd.mp4?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Armed with hammer and nail, plunge your way down through layers of flesh and bone while fighting off divine enemies. Strategize vertically layer-by-layer as you descend through intense combat and lobotomize god.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><br><strong>Lobotomize god through micro-tactics</strong><br>Share one big hammer amongst your units\u2014attack enemies and strike the Nail to destroy the current floor and fall directly into the next floor of combat!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/f45c445e36204867bead4f95d216c576.poster.avif?t=1720806750\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/f45c445e36204867bead4f95d216c576.webm?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/f45c445e36204867bead4f95d216c576.mp4?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Beef up your arsenal at the Slime Bodega</strong><br>Upgrade your unit\u2019s abilities to influence the vertical strategy. Burst open new God Thoughts that provide passive effects on your run. Build up your squad while traversing through the brain-y biomes of god's head.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/a725777ff1304802575c43200ce12820.poster.avif?t=1720806750\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/a725777ff1304802575c43200ce12820.webm?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/a725777ff1304802575c43200ce12820.mp4?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Survive a drum-and-bass-filled bio-hellscape</strong><br>Deadly enemies and hazards fill squishy environments themed around bone, flesh, and brains. Look before your leap as you crash through layers of combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/ae6b90b82971713dcc059fb061ce35f5.poster.avif?t=1720806750\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/ae6b90b82971713dcc059fb061ce35f5.webm?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682550/extras/ae6b90b82971713dcc059fb061ce35f5.mp4?t=1720806750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Play the demo now!</strong><br><br>DEEPMESS is ongoing development, and planned updates to the demo are coming! Wishlist and join the DEEPMESS Discord to support development!",
